    "label": "24",
    "prompt": "True or False? Let $A$, $B$ and $C$ be sets in a universal set $U$.\n\n$\\overline{A\\cup B\\cup C}=\\overline A\\cap\\overline B\\cap\\overline C$.",
    "layout": "list",
